VPS Avenger overlay (com.platform.vps-avenger)

Parts of this module come from the avenger_control project, a tool that makes VPS Avenger usable
with VoiceOver, and are taken over with its developer's permission, given for this port: its
code, its pages and its sounds may be taken over (2026-10-12). The avenger_control tool has not
been published and has no licence of its own.

  ui/index.html, ui/panel.css, ui/panel.js
      the tool's panel (its panel/pages.py): the markup, the styles and the script, copied and
      then changed where the files say so — the transport to this module, values that were not
      read said as such, and the defects of the port's plan fixed.
  src/geometry.luau, src/tables/*.luau
      the coordinates of Avenger's header, its menu and its zoom list, and of its oscillator
      strip, drums, macros, central area and expansion browser, from the tool's tables (as
      starting values; the files say what is known of each); and in src/tables/pages.luau the
      tool's page tables for the expansion grid (its actions.py and clicker/header_map.py): each
      view's page starts, the scrollbar's clicks for a page and a tile's point on it.
  src/read/*.luau
      the tool's classifiers, ported to shares of one picture: its colour tests and numbers for
      the oscillator tabs' dots, the selected tab's dark strip, a lit button, the drum lock, the
      brighter mode caption, the central tab, DRUM SQ, the macro buttons and FAV; its knob
      readers; its reading of what a recogniser makes of Avenger's blank preset ("Init Preset"),
      of the OSC tabs' captions and of the macro tabs' count; and its recognition of an open
      expansion from the browser's text.
  src/state.luau
      the tool's state for its panel (its dispatcher's state_snapshot), built from what is read.
  src/actions/osc.luau, src/actions/macros.luau, src/act.luau
      the tool's actions on the oscillator strip and the macros (its actions.py and clicker), by
      its names, arguments, points, menu rows and focus targets, each made to read back what it
      changed rather than assume it.
  src/amount.luau
      the tool's amount mode (its actions.py, clicker and panel): its points, travel and buttons
      for the macro knobs, the oscillator's knobs, the 2-band filter and a drum slot's knobs, its
      sentences, and Slider.wav at the limit.
  src/actions/drums.luau, src/read/drums.luau, src/handover.luau (a drum slot's Browse)
      the tool's actions on the Drums tab (its actions.py and clicker): their names, arguments,
      points, menu rows, submenu targets, focus targets and its sentences #9 and #13, each made to
      read back what it changed; its test for a slot's lit button. The rule that reads which slot is
      selected is this module's own.
  src/actions/sample.luau, src/actions/drumsq.luau, src/handover.luau (a row of the sample
  browser, a field of the sample editor, the envelope's Menu and Preset)
      the tool's actions on the sample editor and DRUM SQ (its actions.py and clicker): their
      names, arguments, points, menu rows, focus targets and its sentences #10 and #11, LENGTH's
      steps and its points per four steps, each made to read back what it changed.
  src/read/sample.luau
      the tool's blue test, box and threshold for the sample editor's switches; the editor's tab
      read by its rule for the central tab.
  src/watch.luau
      the tool's DRUM SQ watcher: the pattern AUTO FOLLOW moves to, said while the page is hidden.
  sounds/Open.wav, sounds/Close.wav, sounds/Slider.wav
      the tool's sounds for the page opening and closing and for a knob at its limit.

